          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba e bana bakwa Levi umo bafyalilwe mu mayanda ya bashibo, abali intungulushi sha mayanda ya bashibo, pamo ngefyo balependwa cila umo umo ukulingana ne mpendwa ya mashina yabo, abo ababombele imilimo iya mu ŋanda yakwa Yawe, ukufuma pa myaka amakumi yabili (20) nangu ukucilapo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pantu Davidi atile “Apo Yawe Lesa wa bena Israeli napeela ukutuusha ku bantu bakwe nokuti naisa mukwikala mu Yerusalemu umuyayaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.10.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amaf 10:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kanshi abena Levi nomba takuli ukulasenda Itenti lyakwa Lesa nangu ifipe fyonse ifibomba mwi Tenti ili.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukulingana na mashiwi yakulekelesha ayakwa Davidi, abena Levi babapendele ukufuma pa bali ne myaka amakumi yabili (20) nangu ukucilapo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
