              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Imp 3:5-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imilimo ya bena Levi yali yakwafwa abana bakwa Aroni mu milimo ya mu ŋanda yakwa Yawe, ukuba abakumona pa milimo ya mu mansa, mu miputule ya mumbali, ukusangulula ifipe fyonse ifyamushilo, no kubomba imilimo imbi iyalekana lekana iya mu ŋanda yakwa Lesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebapeelwe ukumona pa mikate iyalebikwa petebulo, ubunga bwa mutuulo wa cabunga, utumikate utwapapatala utwabulamo intutumushi, pa milimo iyakupanga no kusakaanya, elyo ne fipimo fyonse ifyakupenda no kupiminako mu musango onse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebali nokulaima cila lucelo mukutotela no kulumbanya Yawe. Ifi fine efyo bali nokwisa bwekeshapo inshita ya cungulo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kabili nelyo lyonse kwaba ukoca amalambo yakupeela kuli Yawe pa masabata, pakutampa umweshi elyo na pa nshikunkulu shonse ishasalwa. Bali nokulabomba pa cinso cakwa Yawe inshita yonse iyapeelwe ukulingana ne mpendwa iyasontwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
